The netblood-zerotier executable is an independent generic UDP socket companion.
Its original sources and generic local IPC header are under the MIT License.
It contains ZeroTier Sockets (libzt), ZeroTierOne, lwIP, and their dependencies.
No GPL game source, ENet source, or game protocol is linked into this executable.
The games communicate with it using authenticated local UDP datagram IPC.

